{"id":"n1-155","title":"Verbる がままに","romaji":"〜ga mama ni","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses 'letting something happen as it is'; 'just as something does'.","longExplanation":"がままに describes an action happening exactly 'as is,' without intervention or change, often suggesting doing something passively or naturally.","formation":"Verb-dictionary form + がままに","examples":[{"jp":"窓を開けるがままにしておいたら、風が部屋に入ってきました。","romaji":"Mado o akeru ga mama ni shite oitara, kaze ga heya ni haitte kimashita.","en":"I left the window open as it was, and the wind came into the room.","words":[{"surface":"窓","vocabId":"1401400","reading":"まど"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"開ける","vocabId":"1202450","reading":"あける"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まま","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"おい","vocabId":"1179140","reading":"おい","baseForm":"おく"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"た"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"風","vocabId":"1499720","reading":"かぜ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"部屋","vocabId":"1499320","reading":"へや"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"入っ","vocabId":"1465590","reading":"はいる","baseForm":"入る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"き","vocabId":"1221520","reading":"き","baseForm":"くる"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]},{"jp":"彼女は涙を流すがままに、ただ黙って座っていた。","romaji":"Kanojo wa namida o nagasu ga mama ni, tada damatte suwatte ita.","en":"She just sat quietly, letting her tears flow.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"涙","vocabId":"1555930","reading":"なみだ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"流す","vocabId":"1552120","reading":"ながす"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まま","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","